# Step 4.3 — the leader decides on join requests (Flow 2, 2b). Run `bun run dev`; VS Code
# "REST Client" keeps cookies. Sign in as the team's LEADER. Until the inbox exists (4.4), take a
# request id from the database (join_requests.id).
@base = http://localhost:3000
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@requestId = REPLACE_WITH_A_PENDING_REQUEST_ID

### Sign in as the leader
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "pat@example.com", "password": "REPLACE_ME" }

### Approve → 200 { request, team }. The requester joins; their other pending requests are
### cancelled (APPROVED_ELSEWHERE); if the team is now full, its other requests are declined
### (TEAM_FULL). Not the leader → 403 NOT_LEADER. Already decided → 409 REQUEST_NOT_PENDING
### (details: status). Team already full → 409 TEAM_FULL, committed: the request is declined.
POST {{base}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

### Decline → 200 { request } (DECLINED, reason LEADER: no re-request to this team, R13)
POST {{base}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/decline
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Step 4.4 — request reads
@teamId = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TEAM_ID
@hackathon = REPLACE_WITH_A_HACKATHON_SLUG

### Leader inbox (leader only): pending oldest first; other statuses newest first.
### { data: { requests: [{ …, requester: { participantId, name, githubUsername, portfolioUrl,
### skills } }], totalCount }, nextCursor }. A cursor only works for the status it came from.
GET {{base}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/requests?status=PENDING&limit=20

### Inbox: declined ones
GET {{base}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/requests?status=DECLINED

### My requests in a hackathon (every status, newest first, with a team summary).
### Not registered → an empty list.
GET {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/me/requests

### Team page: viewer.myRequest = my most recent request to this team (or null)
GET {{base}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}
